WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.700
Lab 2 does the same with a
real test environment's runs.

2
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:08.452
You need the run folder from an earlier
module's Lab 2, in a test tenant,

3
00:00:08.452 --> 00:00:13.288
account, tenancy or project, never
production, kept on agency storage.

4
00:00:13.288 --> 00:00:15.466
You also need a new evidence folder,

5
00:00:15.466 --> 00:00:19.149
a new routing state file, and
the test change record's number.

6
00:00:19.149 --> 00:00:22.637
Route and digest the test
collection with the lab's routing.

7
00:00:22.637 --> 00:00:26.587
Record all three runs with the
change record, and check the chain.

8
00:00:26.587 --> 00:00:31.374
Then do the step no script can: give the
digest to the test environment's owners,

9
00:00:31.374 --> 00:00:35.487
and ask whether each action-required
row reached the right person.

10
00:00:35.487 --> 00:00:39.854
To back it out, keep the evidence of
the test stage with its change record,

11
00:00:39.854 --> 00:00:42.962
and delete only the copies
outside agency storage.

12
00:00:42.962 --> 00:00:45.112
The authors haven't run Lab 2.

13
00:00:45.112 --> 00:00:48.380
The workbook's Chapter 7
has the exact commands.
